{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>תשימנו מדון</b> — like ויהי ריב ומדון, for this is what the Sadducee says in his portion." "<b>And the sense of ילעגו למו</b> — a pronoun on account of the honor of the Name, for He is the vine that You transported from before, and like it: אשר לא נשא לשוא נפשי." "<b>And the sense of ילעגו</b> — that You cannot help us." "<b>And the sense of saying a second time: Elohim, restore us</b> — an allusion to Judah, who was exiled twice."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 80, :notes {0 "The epithet 'השכן' (literally 'the neighbor') likely refers to the Karaite; resolved by inference from Ibn Ezra's standard usage."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:32.230232442Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}